        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyi ni yo ntara yahawe umuryango wa Manase imfura ya Yosefu. Makiri, imfura ya Manase ari we sekuruza w’Abagileyadi, yahawe Gileyadi na Bashani, kuko Abagileyadi bari abahizi mu ntambara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho hantu baronse hari hagenewe ikindi gice c’uwo muryango wa Manase; ugizwe n’abakuru b’inzu zo mu muryango ari bo: Abiyezeri, Heleki, Asiriyeli, Shekemu, Heferi na Shemida. Abo ni abandi bagabo bakomoka kuri Manase umuhungu wa Yosefu, ukurikije inzu baserukira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ico gihe Zelofehadi mwene Heferi, Heferi mwene Gileyadi, Gileyadi mwene Makiri, Makiri mwene Manase, ntiyari yaravyaye abahungu, yari yavyaye abakobwa gusa. Na bo bari aba: Mahala, Nowa, Hogula, Milika na Tiriza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze baragenda babwira umuherezi Eliyazeri, Yosuwa mwene Nuni, n’abatware, bati: “",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " yategetse Mose kuduha iragi muri benewacu.” Nuko Yosuwa aca abaha iragi co kimwe na benewabo, nk’uko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " yari yarabitegetse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iragi rya Manase ryose hamwe ryangana n’amatongo icumi, hongeweko n’amatongo ya Gileyadi na Bashani mu buseruko bwa Yorodani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuko abakobwa bo mu ruvyaro rwa Manase baronse itongo co kimwe na basaza babo. Itongo ry’i Gileyadi ryaciye ritwarwa n’uruvyaro rwa Manase rwari rusigaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
